# Two-post ONE-WAY overhead gantry. Native +Z up, +Y across carriageway.
# Root is ONE carriageway centre at ground datum, posts Y +/-8.1. Scale 1.
# Two reserved blank legend regions, same-facing signs, no baked words or hanging brackets.
mtllib Highway_Overhead_Gantry_OneWay.mtl
usemtl shared_atlas
s off
o left_support
g left_support
